   "text": "Many factors beyond a teammate's pre-absence initiation profile or minutes could influence who takes on the absent player's primary types. These include coaching strategy, availability of other players, opponent matchups, team chemistry, and the specific skills of available teammates. Without robust controls or a larger sample, these confounders will make causal inference difficult."
